{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1706745600, "end_date": 1707436799, "month_true_total": 231, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:51:33 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "157877397", "author": {"steamid": "76561198881615480", "personaname": "FalconDnkyPunch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198881615480/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 69550, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 66572, "last_played": 1767602442, "avatar": "db793372787a5581101552efc9f29939f078f498"}, "language": "english", "review": "No longer updated. Still very fun if you like gauntlet like games and a challenge. \n\nThe Ai is wonderful, it literally does everything within its power to annihilate you. Even if it means it has to cheat. This is what made the game a lot of fun. But overtime, it gets predictable and with the right build/knowledge you can fly through no hope act 1 literally punching all zombies/muties, aside maybe the ogre, into oblivion. Which is still fun, just in a different way. \n\nSo many small stupid things helped bury this game. Hype/clout, aim assist issues (just turn it off, trust me), double mutie spawns, ghost rounds, god like melee, ammo eco, the most negative press you can imagine, and ultimately selling. A difficult game turned into an unfair game to most and it went downhill from there. It really seemed like, no matter how accessible they made it, people just ♥♥♥♥ all over it because it was the thing to do that year. Which I get, because the game is still hard as ♥♥♥♥ sometimes. Especially if you don't know how to stack damage cards, boost trauma healing, and copper eco. Which isn't described in game from what I can tell and is only really ever explained on Reddit by other players. \n\nUltimately, and in a literal sense, this game was left for dead...lol\nBut its still fun AF.", "timestamp_created": 1707424414, "timestamp_updated": 1707488166, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157876348", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045726507", "personaname": "meddox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/meddox995/", "num_games_owned": 231, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 698, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 698, "last_played": 1702235933, "avatar": "a5172ddaf8a3f99baf1636a8e4cbc4d6003b3839"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game will be interesting for about 10 hrs and after that it's just downhill.", "timestamp_created": 1707423270, "timestamp_updated": 1707423270, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.547697365283966064", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157843237", "author": {"steamid": "76561199101270092", "personaname": "POLEXXOR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199101270092/", "num_games_owned": 14, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 584, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 343, "last_played": 1767882174, "avatar": "cd3cfbc80ec79e8483b8577a561ad8cb087ac2ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "گیمش خداس", "timestamp_created": 1707392854, "timestamp_updated": 1707392854, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.459518581628799438", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_durin